[57.674718, "i", "cat > ISSUE_RESOLUTION.txt << 'EOF'\n=== RSYNC BACKUP ISSUE - RESOLVED ===\n\nPROBLEM:\n--------\nThe rsync backup job was running successfully (exit 0) but not transferring\nany files from source to dest for about a week.\n\nROOT CAUSE:\n-----------\nThe exclude.lst file was updated on 2024-01-09 (likely \"last Tuesday\") with:\n  *\n  !.gitkeep\n\nThe '*' pattern excluded ALL files from the sync.\nThe '!.gitkeep' pattern is gitignore syntax and doesn't work with rsync\n(rsync doesn't support '!' negation patterns).\n\nSOLUTION:\n---------\nCleared the exclude.lst file, removing the problematic '*' pattern.\nBackup of the old file saved as exclude.lst.backup.\n\nRESULT:\n-------\n✓ Sync now working correctly\n✓ All 217 files from source successfully synced to dest\n✓ Latest sync transferred 799,454 bytes successfully\n✓ Dest directory now mirrors source as expected\n\nNOTE:\n-----\nIf specific files/patterns need to be excluded, add them to exclude.lst\nusing rsync-compatible patterns (not gitignore syntax).\nEOF\n"]
